[node name="EndingTextLabel" type="Label" parent="CenterContainer/Panel/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
text = "The final uplink stabilizes.
At first there is only static. Then voices.

Weak. Broken. Human.

Against all expectations, survivors remained alive inside sealed emergency shelters linked to the final airport network.
Your route did not just recover lost infrastructure. It found people.

437 survivors confirmed.
For the first time since the storm, command has a living signal to answer.

The drill is spent. The hull is scarred.
But the mission succeeded. You found them.
"
horizontal_alignment = 1

